{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00027","headline":"春日望海 · 太宗皇帝","name":"春日望海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"披襟眺沧海，凭轼翫春芳。\n积流横地纪，疎派引天潢。\n仙气凝三岭，和风扇八荒。\n拂潮云布色，穿浪日舒光。\n照岸花分彩，迷云雁断行。\n怀卑运深广，持满守灵长。\n有形非易测，无源讵可量。\n洪涛经变野，翠岛屡成桑。\n之罘思汉帝，碣石想秦皇。\n霓裳非本意，端拱且图王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}